---
title: "repay_flash_loan (Current Finance: Flash Loan)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: ensure_version_matches + validate_market
    q_validate --> q_check_ongoing: assert flash_loan_ongoing
    q_check_ongoing --> q_finish: asset.flash_loan_finished()
    q_finish --> q_unpack: FlashLoan { inner, fee } = loan
    q_unpack --> q_check_repay: assert coin.value == inner.amount + fee
    q_check_repay --> q_split_fee: fee_coin = coin.split(fee)
    q_split_fee --> q_check_referral: maybe_referral_code.is_some?
    q_check_referral --> q_track_referral: referral.track_flash_loan_usage(fee_coin)
    q_check_referral --> q_reserve_repay: reserve.repay_flash_loan(inner, coin, fee_coin)
    q_track_referral --> q_check_fee_after: assert fee_coin.value != 0 after rebate
    q_check_fee_after --> q_reserve_repay: reserve.repay_flash_loan(inner, coin, fee_coin)
    q_reserve_repay --> q_verify_amount: assert coin.value == inner.amount
    q_verify_amount --> q_deposit_back: underlying_balance.join(coin)
    q_deposit_back --> q_add_fee: fee goes to cash_reserve
    q_add_fee --> [*]

    note right of q_unpack
        INV-001: FlashLoan hot potato consumed, preventing orphaned loans
        INV-002: Exact repay amount required (principal + fee)
        INV-003: Fee after referral rebate must be non-zero (no free flash loans)
        INV-004: Fee deposited to cash_reserve (protocol revenue), not to depositors
        INV-005: flash_loan_finished clears re-entrancy guard
    end note
